ark"/></a><a href="#" class="table-box _2 w-inline-block"><div class="p3 is--black row-p">N/A</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/647b5b55f3f42fc50b2f6e29/647b5b55f3f42fc50b2f6e95_PDF%20file%20icon.svg" width="32" alt="" class="bookmark"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="resources"><div class="p2 is--left is--black is--bold col-h1 b--20">NSAA Section 2</div><p class="p1 is--black no-max-width">The style of NSAA Section 2 has changed several times. It has been a multiple-choice test since 2020, with sections in Physics, Chemistry and Biology. It requires more advanced knowledge than the ESAT, but it is still a useful practice resource.<br/><br/>From 2016-2019, NSAA Section 2 required long answers, so it is not as relevant to the ESAT. It is a very good resource to practice applying your knowledge to unfamiliar contexts, particularly if you are anticipating a university interview.<br/></p><div class="table-wrapper"><div class="table-row head first"><div class="table-box tes-paper"><div class="p2 is--left is--black is--bold col-h1">NSAA Section 2</div></div><div class="table-box"><div class="p2 is--left is--black is--bold col-h1">Answer Key</div></div><div class="table-box"><div class="p2 is--left is--black is--bold col-h1">Explained Answers</div></div><div class="table-box align-center"><div class="p2 is--left is--black is--bold col-h1">Score Conversion Table</div></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="table-row"><a href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/647b5b55f3f42fc50b2f6e4e/665b6121527b94190ba2e8b3_NSAA%202023%20Section%202%20-%20Question%20Paper.pdf" target="_blank" class="table-box _2 w-inline-block"><div class="p3 is--black is--bold is--row">2023 Section 2</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/647b5b55f3f42fc50b2f6e29/647b5b55f3f42fc50b2f6e95_PDF%20file%20icon.svg" width="32" alt="" class="bookmark"/></a><a href="https://cdn.prod